WEBVTT

00:16.380 --> 00:19.980
<b>Your eyes that look far
off into the distance</b>

00:19.980 --> 00:23.620
<b>They're listening to the
voice within your heart</b>

00:23.620 --> 00:27.610
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:30.990 --> 00:34.530
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:38.200
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.200 --> 00:42.160
<b>Illuminate the night
that dawns too soon</b>

00:45.510 --> 00:52.750
<b>Even alone, I want to
keep on believing in you</b>

00:52.750 --> 01:00.060
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

01:00.060 --> 01:03.690
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.690 --> 01:07.300
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.300 --> 01:14.570
<b>We'll meet here again
someday, if that's the truth</b>

01:14.570 --> 01:18.210
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.210 --> 01:24.950
<b>The reality that I reached
out and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:24.950 --> 01:28.710
<b>Let it go, let's believe in it</b>

01:31.350 --> 01:32.820
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

01:59.780 --> 02:01.250
<b>We knew it all along.</b>

02:05.650 --> 02:08.020
<b>No one wanted this fight to happen.</b>

02:12.730 --> 02:14.190
<b>But...</b>

02:17.500 --> 02:18.970
<b>Sister!</b>

02:19.600 --> 02:21.430
<b>We have no choice but to fight!</b>

02:46.190 --> 02:47.660
<b>En garde!</b>

03:01.340 --> 03:03.380
<b>Come on, Gojyo, can I?</b>

03:03.380 --> 03:06.620
<b>No, kids like you can go suck
on a pacifier or something.</b>

03:06.620 --> 03:10.420
<b>What the hell?! Why can't I have
a little of your beer snacks?!</b>

03:10.420 --> 03:12.050
<b>You pervy water sprite drunkard!</b>

03:13.490 --> 03:14.960
<b>You just keep babbling.</b>

03:21.100 --> 03:22.560
<b>Women?</b>

03:38.750 --> 03:43.290
<b>You were such a great help. I don't
know how we can thank you.</b>

03:43.290 --> 03:45.280
<b>So, you guys are sisters?</b>

03:45.890 --> 03:49.020
<b>That's right, we're actually
pretty good friends too.</b>

03:49.690 --> 03:52.560
<b>Are you travelers on a journey?</b>

03:53.090 --> 03:56.330
<b>Yes, well, it's more like
a fieldtrip though.</b>

03:57.170 --> 04:00.140
<b>You guys must go through
some tough times, right?</b>

04:00.140 --> 04:02.100
<b>It's no big deal.</b>

04:02.100 --> 04:04.070
<b>Sometimes Goku's feet smell,</b>

04:04.070 --> 04:06.010
<b>and the stinking monk's
always firing his gun,</b>

04:06.010 --> 04:07.510
<b>but that's about it.</b>

04:07.510 --> 04:09.270
<b>And sometimes demons attack us.</b>

04:24.830 --> 04:26.290
<b>Does it not suit your tastes?</b>

04:30.670 --> 04:34.030
<b>We heard this was the
best restaurant in town.</b>

04:43.750 --> 04:46.310
<b>Then, we'll be going now.</b>

04:46.310 --> 04:47.680
<b>You're lifesavers.</b>

04:47.680 --> 04:49.580
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

04:52.490 --> 04:53.950
<b>Bye-bye!</b>

04:55.320 --> 04:56.890
<b>There they go.</b>

04:56.890 --> 04:59.460
<b>Goku, you have a crush, don't you?</b>

04:59.460 --> 05:01.460
<b>Don't be stupid!</b>

05:01.460 --> 05:03.470
<b>You've been in a rut all year
long, you pervy water sprite!</b>

05:03.470 --> 05:05.230
<b>I'm not like you!</b>

05:05.230 --> 05:07.700
<b>Don't mess with me! You wanna
see what it's like to die?!</b>

05:07.700 --> 05:10.470
<b>You just try it if you can!</b>

05:10.470 --> 05:12.040
<b>Break, break.</b>

05:12.040 --> 05:13.510
<b>Let's go.</b>

05:18.980 --> 05:23.010
<b>What's wrong, Sanzo? You
haven't been looking too happy.</b>

05:24.920 --> 05:27.440
<b>Don't get too involved with them.</b>

05:33.260 --> 05:36.530
<b>This is what happens
when we get involved.</b>

05:36.530 --> 05:37.230
<b>But...</b>

05:37.230 --> 05:38.930
<b>It's just a coincidence.</b>

05:38.930 --> 05:42.890
<b>Those girls don't have anything
to do with this. Right, Goku?</b>

05:45.610 --> 05:47.340
<b>Was that a coincidence too?</b>

05:47.340 --> 05:48.810
<b>Of course!</b>

05:53.050 --> 05:54.520
<b>Idiots.</b>

05:58.250 --> 05:59.720
<b>Sanzo, look out!</b>

06:07.960 --> 06:09.430
<b>Sanzo!</b>

06:12.500 --> 06:14.940
<b>Are you still going to insist
it's a coincidence?</b>

06:14.940 --> 06:17.040
<b>Things like this happen all the time</b>

06:17.040 --> 06:19.510
<b>during scientific experiments
and in the middle of cooking.</b>

06:21.280 --> 06:23.080
<b>Do what you want.</b>

06:23.080 --> 06:24.910
<b>I think I'll do just that.</b>

06:26.380 --> 06:28.470
<b>Gojyo, where're you going?</b>

06:29.720 --> 06:31.810
<b>I'm going to go win
some pocket change.</b>

06:33.190 --> 06:36.020
<b>We depart tomorrow. You guys
better not be late either.</b>

06:47.240 --> 06:49.200
<b>What's taking you so long?</b>

06:49.200 --> 06:52.470
<b>You must have had plenty
of chances to kill them.</b>

06:54.440 --> 06:58.110
<b>I thought we were allowed to
determine that for ourselves.</b>

07:06.220 --> 07:08.690
<b>Bitch, do you mean to defy me?!</b>

07:09.320 --> 07:12.050
<b>No, I'm just...</b>

07:12.630 --> 07:19.170
<b>I could kill you and your darling
little sisters right now. Well?</b>

07:19.170 --> 07:23.340
<b>You promised me! Please don't
do anything to my sisters!</b>

07:23.340 --> 07:25.970
<b>Then you better watch
how you talk to me!</b>

07:28.710 --> 07:30.480
<b>Don't worry.</b>

07:30.480 --> 07:32.450
<b>Once you get rid of Sanzo and
his companions,</b>

07:32.450 --> 07:36.020
<b>I'll leave your body, just
like I promised,</b>

07:36.020 --> 07:39.350
<b>and I'll let all four
of you go free.</b>

07:39.350 --> 07:42.590
<b>I'm sure your little sisters
will be overjoyed.</b>

07:42.590 --> 07:46.820
<b>But that's only IF you can kill them.</b>

07:57.610 --> 07:59.270
<b>Oh, Donghua!</b>

07:59.270 --> 08:00.740
<b>Hey!</b>

08:04.110 --> 08:05.580
<b>Gojyo!</b>

08:07.980 --> 08:09.580
<b>What an unexpected surprise.</b>

08:09.580 --> 08:11.780
<b>Yeah, a real unexpected surprise.</b>

08:14.760 --> 08:16.220
<b>Thank you so very much.</b>

08:16.760 --> 08:18.320
<b>Is it not too heavy?</b>

08:19.390 --> 08:20.030
<b>Well...</b>

08:20.030 --> 08:25.130
<b>Oh, no, please don't mind us.
We're used to such things.</b>

08:25.130 --> 08:26.470
<b>Right, Goku?</b>

08:26.470 --> 08:28.040
<b>Speak for yourself.</b>

08:28.040 --> 08:29.870
<b>Are you okay, Goku?</b>

08:29.870 --> 08:33.010
<b>I'm okay, I'm okay!
This is a piece of cake!</b>

08:33.010 --> 08:34.570
<b>Are you sure?</b>

08:39.280 --> 08:40.750
<b>What a haul, what a haul.</b>

08:41.380 --> 08:44.080
<b>I think I'm even luckier than usual.</b>

08:46.990 --> 08:48.990
<b>How are things going?</b>

08:48.990 --> 08:50.760
<b>Need I say anything?</b>

08:50.760 --> 08:53.930
<b>I've got the goddess of victory
by my side, after all.</b>

08:53.930 --> 08:55.400
<b>Right?</b>

08:57.930 --> 08:59.400
<b>Hey, what's that?!</b>

09:01.040 --> 09:04.310
<b>Ha, ha, you fell for it! You
really are a stupid monkey.</b>

09:04.310 --> 09:05.860
<b>Hey, how dare you?!</b>

09:14.980 --> 09:17.650
<b>Should I call, or...</b>

09:17.650 --> 09:19.120
<b>Time to call.</b>

09:21.990 --> 09:24.830
<b>Can't argue with the
goddess of victory.</b>

09:24.830 --> 09:26.290
<b>Call!</b>

09:30.830 --> 09:32.300
<b>Damn...</b>

09:52.390 --> 09:53.850
<b>Pardon me.</b>

09:54.590 --> 09:59.360
<b>I heard you were staying at
the same inn as us, so...</b>

09:59.990 --> 10:01.800
<b>What do you want?</b>

10:01.800 --> 10:05.330
<b>I was able to obtain
some rare wine,</b>

10:05.330 --> 10:08.330
<b>so I thought perhaps I might
repay your previous kindness.</b>

10:49.710 --> 10:51.180
<b>Is something the matter?</b>

10:53.180 --> 10:54.650
<b>No...</b>

10:58.590 --> 11:01.290
<b>Well, actually...</b>

11:01.290 --> 11:02.760
<b>Would you share a drink with me?</b>

11:03.760 --> 11:05.230
<b>Qiuhua...</b>

11:06.460 --> 11:07.930
<b>It's very delicious.</b>

11:10.430 --> 11:11.900
<b>All right.</b>

11:28.750 --> 11:31.840
<b>Xiahua, go home.</b>

11:35.890 --> 11:39.950
<b>I haven't stooped so low that I'd
take a woman who's not interested.</b>

11:42.830 --> 11:44.300
<b>Gojyo...</b>

11:52.470 --> 11:54.810
<b>You won't speak to me.</b>

11:56.710 --> 11:58.410
<b>Why did you approach us?</b>

11:59.810 --> 12:03.050
<b>I don't know what you're
up to, but don't do it.</b>

12:03.050 --> 12:04.680
<b>It's for your own good.</b>

12:06.350 --> 12:08.420
<b>Leave by tomorrow morning</b>

12:08.420 --> 12:11.220
<b>and never show yourselves
before us again.</b>

12:13.430 --> 12:16.490
<b>Master Sanzo, I don't understand.</b>

12:17.370 --> 12:20.940
<b>There's only one path that's
been set before us,</b>

12:20.940 --> 12:23.740
<b>and we have no choice
but to follow it,</b>

12:23.740 --> 12:27.110
<b>but I don't know if that's
the right thing to do.</b>

12:28.540 --> 12:30.370
<b>Where did you get that idea?</b>

12:34.120 --> 12:37.110
<b>Who said there was only one path?</b>

12:43.490 --> 12:44.960
<b>You're right.</b>

12:46.230 --> 12:47.690
<b>You're right, of course.</b>

12:48.700 --> 12:51.160
<b>Master Sanzo, thank you very much.</b>

12:56.340 --> 12:58.460
<b>Master Sanzo, I have a request.</b>

12:59.410 --> 13:02.470
<b>If the path should disappear,
even then...</b>

13:04.850 --> 13:06.640
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

13:10.720 --> 13:12.190
<b>Chunhua...</b>

13:13.860 --> 13:16.320
<b>You bitch! Do you intend
to betray me?!</b>

13:20.330 --> 13:24.060
<b>Don't you care about your life,
no, your sisters' lives?!</b>

13:25.600 --> 13:30.260
<b>I'll keep my promise,
in my own way.</b>

13:37.510 --> 13:39.670
<b>Sister, I...</b>

13:40.620 --> 13:44.280
<b>But I just can't think
that they're villains.</b>

13:45.150 --> 13:46.320
<b>And...</b>

13:46.320 --> 13:47.490
<b>And?</b>

13:47.490 --> 13:49.380
<b>I care for him.</b>

13:50.260 --> 13:51.730
<b>Then what're we supposed to do?!</b>

13:53.760 --> 13:55.890
<b>We have no other path
to choose from.</b>

13:58.730 --> 14:00.700
<b>I don't care what happens to me!</b>

14:00.700 --> 14:03.330
<b>So please, don't do anything
to my sisters!</b>

14:04.370 --> 14:04.640
<b>Sister!</b>

14:04.640 --> 14:06.110
<b>Sis!
Sister!</b>

14:09.380 --> 14:13.450
<b>That demon said he'd
leave Chunhua's body</b>

14:13.450 --> 14:15.850
<b>if we defeated those people,</b>

14:15.850 --> 14:19.590
<b>but can we really
trust what he says?</b>

14:19.590 --> 14:21.450
<b>That doesn't matter.</b>

14:22.820 --> 14:27.590
<b>Chunhua saved us by putting
her own life at risk.</b>

14:28.160 --> 14:31.150
<b>So, it's our turn to save her now.</b>

14:33.940 --> 14:35.400
<b>You three must run away.</b>

14:36.170 --> 14:38.110
<b>Forget about me</b>

14:38.110 --> 14:42.740
<b>and start a new life...
No, start down a new path.</b>

14:44.880 --> 14:46.350
<b>Sister...</b>

14:49.920 --> 14:51.380
<b>Let's go, Goku.</b>

15:02.900 --> 15:04.360
<b>That's...</b>

15:09.470 --> 15:13.170
<b>Genjo Sanzo, I'm
here for your life.</b>

15:14.480 --> 15:16.610
<b>So that's your answer?</b>

15:16.610 --> 15:18.340
<b>No, it's OUR answer!</b>

15:20.620 --> 15:22.670
<b>You three, why?!</b>

15:23.650 --> 15:25.620
<b>We're sorry, sister.</b>

15:25.620 --> 15:28.250
<b>But this is the path we've chosen.</b>

15:47.540 --> 15:50.340
<b>What the heck?! What the
hell's going on here?!</b>

15:58.320 --> 15:59.790
<b>En garde!</b>

16:03.260 --> 16:05.190
<b>So this is how it always ends.</b>

16:06.560 --> 16:08.200
<b>Why?!</b>

16:08.200 --> 16:10.860
<b>Why do we have to
fight each other?!</b>

16:12.130 --> 16:13.130
<b>Die!</b>

16:13.130 --> 16:14.600
<b>Stop!</b>

16:17.670 --> 16:19.140
<b>I thought as much.</b>

16:21.340 --> 16:23.280
<b>That scar is that of a
parasite demon!</b>

16:23.280 --> 16:25.680
<b>So that's what this is about.</b>

16:25.680 --> 16:28.910
<b>I don't get it! What's this about?!</b>

16:30.920 --> 16:34.590
<b>That's a scar left behind
by a parasite demon.</b>

16:34.590 --> 16:38.960
<b>There should be another demon
dwelling inside her body.</b>

16:38.960 --> 16:40.530
<b>No way!</b>

16:40.530 --> 16:44.030
<b>Then if we kill that
whatchamacallit demon...</b>

16:44.030 --> 16:47.700
<b>It's impossible. It will have
assimilated her internal organs,</b>

16:47.700 --> 16:50.140
<b>so we won't be able to kill
just the parasite demon.</b>

16:51.540 --> 16:55.680
<b>And if a parasite demon
leaves its host,</b>

16:55.680 --> 16:58.080
<b>the host will die automatically!</b>

16:59.710 --> 17:01.220
<b>No...</b>

17:01.220 --> 17:02.680
<b>Sis...</b>

17:04.150 --> 17:05.750
<b>You bastard!</b>

17:05.750 --> 17:07.390
<b>Then die!</b>

17:07.390 --> 17:09.220
<b>Along with my accursed body!</b>

17:11.460 --> 17:12.930
<b>Sister!
Sister!
Sis!</b>

17:15.430 --> 17:20.400
<b>Ah-ah, not so fast. You're
my precious hostage.</b>

17:20.400 --> 17:21.870
<b>Bastard...</b>

17:22.400 --> 17:24.040
<b>You're such fools.</b>

17:24.040 --> 17:26.640
<b>If you hadn't said such
unnecessary things,</b>

17:26.640 --> 17:29.440
<b>they'd have been allowed
to stay themselves.</b>

17:29.440 --> 17:30.910
<b>What did you say?!</b>

17:36.950 --> 17:38.550
<b>Donghua!</b>

17:38.550 --> 17:42.320
<b>So you planted seeds in them too!</b>

17:44.760 --> 17:49.560
<b>Did you think I'd leave the
younger sisters alone?!</b>

17:49.560 --> 17:52.050
<b>You bastard, you're not
getting away with this!</b>

17:52.670 --> 17:55.300
<b>Are you sure you don't
mind hurting me?</b>

17:55.300 --> 17:59.030
<b>Because these women
are still alive.</b>

18:02.210 --> 18:03.680
<b>Get them!</b>

18:06.550 --> 18:09.020
<b>Goku, please get a
hold of yourself!</b>

18:09.020 --> 18:12.010
<b>But that's Donghua!</b>

18:12.690 --> 18:13.790
<b>Goku...</b>

18:13.790 --> 18:16.960
<b>Kill me and the women will die too.</b>

18:16.960 --> 18:18.520
<b>You can't do that, now can you?</b>

18:19.260 --> 18:22.490
<b>You don't have it in
you to kill them.</b>

18:25.330 --> 18:28.340
<b>Master Sanzo, I have a request.</b>

18:28.340 --> 18:31.170
<b>If the path should
disappear, even then...</b>

18:32.970 --> 18:34.910
<b>If that's what you want then.</b>

18:34.910 --> 18:36.380
<b>What?!</b>

18:39.550 --> 18:41.070
<b>Makai Tenjou!</b>

18:51.530 --> 18:53.020
<b>This is the end.</b>

18:55.530 --> 18:56.830
<b>Stop...</b>

18:56.830 --> 18:58.400
<b>Don't do it!</b>

18:58.930 --> 19:00.000
<b>Goku...</b>

19:00.000 --> 19:01.940
<b>Don't do it, Sanzo!</b>

19:01.940 --> 19:04.100
<b>Let go of my hand, Goku!</b>

19:04.100 --> 19:05.610
<b>No!</b>

19:05.610 --> 19:07.640
<b>Just let go!</b>

19:07.640 --> 19:10.280
<b>I won't let go! I'll never let go!</b>

19:10.280 --> 19:16.020
<b>Because that's Chunhua!
And Xiahua and Qiuhua!</b>

19:16.020 --> 19:19.380
<b>I just got to know Donghua! Why?!</b>

19:21.160 --> 19:22.780
<b>Why does it have to be this way?!</b>

19:23.620 --> 19:26.020
<b>Let go of my hand, Goku.</b>

19:57.590 --> 19:59.060
<b>Goku!</b>

20:08.100 --> 20:10.200
<b>So there was another path?</b>

20:20.350 --> 20:23.810
<b>We've finally been freed
from our suffering.</b>

20:27.120 --> 20:28.590
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:40.100 --> 20:46.510
<b>That's right, even
sudden tragedies come</b>

20:46.510 --> 20:51.880
<b>Looking good-natured,
without cause for suspicion</b>

20:51.880 --> 20:57.380
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

20:57.380 --> 21:00.790
<b>And look up</b>

21:00.790 --> 21:06.590
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:06.590 --> 21:12.030
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:12.030 --> 21:17.340
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:17.340 --> 21:21.270
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:28.280 --> 21:31.920
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:31.920 --> 21:33.890
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:33.890 --> 21:37.990
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:37.990 --> 21:42.160
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:42.160 --> 21:44.800
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:44.800 --> 21:49.870
<b>Standing next to the taunt pressure</b>

21:49.870 --> 21:55.280
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

21:55.280 --> 22:00.710
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:00.710 --> 22:04.780
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>
